      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……变革同学，在前几天的『天皇赏（秋）』\n也，闯入了前五。",
      "source_fingerprint": "daff59a782533e7161b7e1b27d69886b406af31482e97b9906e1ae9d24ae0b3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
